 R←Test_44(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;i;list;log;state
⍝ `Process` with `stormGuard` 1: five occurrences of one error get the full treatment three times; all five are logged
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 #.⎕SHADOW'HandleErrorParms'
 #.HandleErrorParms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 #.HandleErrorParms.killThreads←0                    ⍝ Killing threads would kill the session's own threads
 #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 #.HandleErrorParms.saveErrorWS←0
 #.HandleErrorParms.stormGuard←1
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.∆TheLog←''
 #.TEMP.⎕FX'{r}←∆CustomLogFns msg' '∆TheLog,←{1≥≡⍵:⊂⍵ ⋄ ⍵}msg'
 #.HandleErrorParms.logFunction←'#.TEMP.∆CustomLogFns'
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder

 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process #.HandleErrorParms')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 :For i :In ⍳5
     :Trap 406
         {⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
         →T.GoToTidyUp 1
     :EndTrap
 :EndFor

 list←FilesAndDirs.ListFiles #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder,'/*.html'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 3≠≢list                                ⍝ Occurrences 1, 2 and 4
 →T.GoToTidyUp 5≢#.HandleErrorParms.stormCount
 →T.GoToTidyUp'405'≢3↑#.HandleErrorParms.stormSignature
 log←#.TEMP.∆TheLog
 →T.GoToTidyUp 5≠+/∨/¨'Storm guard: occurrence '∘⍷¨log
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠+/∨/¨'held back'∘⍷¨log              ⍝ Occurrences 3 and 5
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'held back'⍷⊃⌽log                  ⍝ The last one is among them
 state←##.HandleError.ReadStormFile #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder,'/StormGuard.txt'
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,5)≢state.counts
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,4)≢state.lastFulls

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
